#: fsview_part.cpp:243
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"FSView intentionally does not support automatic updates when changes are "
"made to files or directories, currently visible in FSView, from the "
"outside.\n"
"For details, see the 'Help/FSView Manual'."
msgstr ""
"FSView nun sofita de mou intencionáu l'anovamientu automáticu de "
"ficheros o direutorios (visibles anguaño en FSView) cuando se-yos faen "
"cambeos dende fuera.\n"
"Pa más detalles, mira «Help/FSView Manual» nel manual d'ayuda."

